{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search object, grab and transport it to destination using object properties. If not visible, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    />\"",
